  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On 22/07/2026, the proposed use of 55 Eastbury Grove, Chiswick, W4 2JT for the proposed conversion of flats back to a house and erection of a Juliet balcony and sliding doors to the rear of the property is not lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) because:\r\n\r\nThe submitted information fails to demonstrate that the proposal would not materially affect the external appearance of the building under Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). Planning permission is therefore required.\r\n"
